{"story_id":14803,"updated_at":"2026-10-08T22:47:51","headline_en":"All 23 Indian crew members rescued from burning tanker Aframax Rio","headline_hi":"जलते हुए टैंकर Aframax Rio से सभी 23 भारतीय चालक दल के सदस्य बचाए गए","payload_en":{"story_id":14803,"headline":"All 23 Indian crew members rescued from burning tanker Aframax Rio","counts":{"outlets":12,"articles":12,"independent_sources":9},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Hindustan Times","NDTV","PGurus","The Federal","The Guardian","The Hindu","The Indian EYE","The Moscow Times","The New Indian Express"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":14579,"parents":[{"headline":"Drone reportedly strikes oil tanker Aframax Rio in Black Sea","story_id":14579}],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-08T22:47:51","category":{"primary":["world"],"secondary":["indians-abroad","conflicts"]},"places":[],"people":["Russian Black Sea","Aframax Rio","MV Royal Mammadov","Russia","Embassy in Romania","Sirius","Ukrainian","Romanian"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"ids":[41574],"text":"A Liberian-flagged oil tanker named Aframax Rio caught fire off the Russian Black Sea coast on Tuesday.","class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5]}],[{"ids":[41572],"text":"Commercial shipping in the Black Sea has faced increasing attacks since the Russia-Ukraine war began in 2022.","class":"single","sources":[5]},{"ids":[41588],"text":"Russia and Ukraine continue to target energy infrastructure and commercial shipping linked to the war in and around the Black Sea.","class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"ids":[41577],"text":"There were no reports of injuries among the crew of the Aframax Rio.","class":"unverified","sources":[2,4,7]},{"ids":[42107],"text":"Crude oil is burning openly in the waters of the Black Sea.","class":"single","sources":[8]},{"ids":[42103],"text":"The Ministry of External Affairs of India views attacks on commercial shipping with grave concern.","class":"single","sources":[7]},{"ids":[41590],"text":"On Tuesday, Sochi Mayor Andrey Proshunin closed the city's beaches and waterfront promenades.","class":"unverified","sources":[1,3,7]},{"ids":[42114],"text":"Authorities in the Sirius federal territory restricted public access to nearby beaches and coastal areas.","class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"ids":[41581],"text":"A Liberian-flagged oil tanker was struck by Ukrainian naval drones off Russia’s southern coast on Tuesday, unnamed sources said.","class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,5,6,7,8]},{"ids":[41575],"text":"The Aframax Rio was attacked by naval drones, the Russian Transport Ministry reported on Tuesday.","class":"single","sources":[4]},{"ids":[41582],"text":"All 23 Indian crew members aboard the Liberian-flagged tanker were rescued, the ministry said on Tuesday.","class":"unverified","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]}],[{"ids":[41571,41591,41594],"text":"The intensity of the fire prevented firefighters from tackling the blaze, Russia’s transport ministry said on Wednesday, though the ministry added that firefighters extinguished the blaze on the Aframax Rio and that the fire on board did not cause an oil spill.","class":"single","sources":[3,5]},{"ids":[41578],"text":"However, Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy stated that the vessel was struck by a Russian drone.","class":"single","sources":[4]}],[{"ids":[41587],"text":"Dmitry Plishkin, head of the Sirius federal territory, announced the temporary closure of local beaches due to the tanker fire.","class":"single","sources":[6]},{"ids":[41595],"text":"Sirius officials closed all beaches and urged residents to limit time outdoors.","class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"ids":[42104],"text":"On October 5, 2026, a Russian drone strike caused a fire on a Turkish-owned civilian cargo vessel in the Black Sea, killing at least two people and injuring crew members including one Indian.","class":"single","sources":[7]},{"ids":[42115],"text":"A separate attack involved the commercial vessel MV Royal Mammadov off the Romanian coast, resulting in injuries to Indian sailors.","class":"single","sources":[2]},{"ids":[41567],"text":"A ship caught fire and sank off the Romanian coast, killing one person and leaving another missing.","class":"single","sources":[1]},{"ids":[41573],"text":"Last month, Russia targeted grain vessels carrying Ukrainian goods near the coast of Romania.","class":"single","sources":[5]}],[{"ids":[41583],"text":"Unnamed sources said that a Russian drone strike sparked a fire aboard the Turkish-owned civilian cargo vessel MV Royal Mammadov.","class":"single","sources":[6]},{"ids":[41584],"text":"The Indian Embassy in Romania stated that two people were killed and several crew members were injured on the MV Royal Mammadov.","class":"single","sources":[6]},{"ids":[41585],"text":"The Indian Embassy confirmed three Indian nationals were among the crew of the MV Royal Mammadov.","class":"single","sources":[6]},{"ids":[41586],"text":"The Indian Embassy said that one Indian national from the MV Royal Mammadov is receiving medical attention in Romania.","class":"single","sources":[6]}],[{"ids":[42108],"text":"Bulgarian Prime Minister Rumen Radev stated on Tuesday that two commercial vessels were struck by drones in Bulgaria’s exclusive economic zone in the Black Sea.","class":"single","sources":[8]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","say","say","say","related","related","related"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://thefederal.com/category/news/ukrainian-drone-attack-sets-oil-tanker-ablaze-off-sochi-all-23-indian-crew-members-rescued-258794","read":true,"title":"'Ukrainian' drone attack sets oil tanker ablaze off Sochi, all 23 Indian crew members rescued","outlet":"The Federal","readable":true,"perspective":"–"},{"n":2,"url":"https://theindianeye.com/2026/10/08/23-indian-crew-members-rescued-after-ukraine-drone-attack-sets-oil-tanker-on-fire-near-russian-coast/","read":true,"title":"23 Indian crew members rescued after Ukraine Drone att